{
 "L01": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_427f5770-5660-4c1f-93b8-122aae13f827.mp3",
  "text": "Four years ago, this was what AI video looked like.",
  "section": "s1"
 },
 "L02": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_3a06e30b-0958-4c98-b54b-0d70381ab1d6.mp3",
  "text": "This is what four years did.",
  "section": "s1"
 },
 "L03": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_5338a6d3-76f1-4358-b76c-a50dbcec2795.mp3",
  "text": "In 2022, research labs showed that plain words could become moving pictures.",
  "section": "s2"
 },
 "L04": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_d4cb079e-08ec-46f6-abe7-d1226a6cf83e.mp3",
  "text": "But clips lasted a few seconds, and early animation drew every frame on its own.",
  "section": "s2"
 },
 "L05": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_9224cb0d-c942-436b-be68-2024d51deb3c.mp3",
  "text": "So faces drifted. Objects melted.",
  "section": "s2"
 },
 "L06": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_68be1c66-5dc1-4187-84e4-2cbc4fae27d7.mp3",
  "text": "In 2023, Runway's Gen-2 put text-to-video into public hands.",
  "section": "s3"
 },
 "L07": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_265c709f-f9bb-4baf-b4fa-8dc8dbede85d.mp3",
  "text": "Then, in February 2024, OpenAI previewed Sora, promising up to a minute of video.",
  "section": "s3"
 },
 "L08": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220452_90e8a6cb-d0c6-4016-8d90-fad257ad219f.mp3",
  "text": "Suddenly, a subject could hold together across a shot. It reset expectations.",
  "section": "s3"
 },
 "L09": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_3cde8a11-d34e-4fb7-8cd3-5e496bc83e92.mp3",
  "text": "Then the race began. In June 2024 alone, Kling, Luma and Runway all showed new models.",
  "section": "s4"
 },
 "L10": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_49c4d4ea-452d-475c-a1f8-fc25249b576d.mp3",
  "text": "By December, Sora was public, and Google's Veo 2 arrived a week later.",
  "section": "s4"
 },
 "L11": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_35334318-993d-43db-9470-e61d5bf0765b.mp3",
  "text": "In May 2025, Veo 3 generated sound along with the picture.",
  "section": "s4"
 },
 "L15": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220433_7a5df1dd-367a-46df-8c01-1a6a6cac5cf6.mp3",
  "text": "By September 2026, developers announce thirty-second clips, native 4K, and generated sound.",
  "section": "s6"
 },
 "L16": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220452_73a0548c-a05d-45bc-9f99-facc0c7f1924.mp3",
  "text": "Light behaves. Water moves. Shots hold together for seconds, not frames.",
  "section": "s6"
 },
 "L18": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220452_6897aee4-5653-48f0-b388-ee90a6fa548d.mp3",
  "text": "Even Sora, the 2024 sensation, was shut down this year.",
  "section": "s6"
 },
 "L19": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220452_2a633284-0a34-4d14-a3bf-27ab59b384bc.mp3",
  "text": "Now the frame itself is changing. Genie 3 builds worlds you can steer, in real time.",
  "section": "s7"
 },
 "L20": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220451_2247b8c5-3fd2-4380-8f2e-66d751cb7dbc.mp3",
  "text": "Motion was the miracle. Now it's the baseline.",
  "section": "s7"
 },
 "L21": {
  "url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_2vqT0Ah9P4GmOaY4MT4rr1viFY5/hf_20260929_220451_b65d8b53-431d-4d13-b962-ef9f91440fd4.mp3",
  "text": "From melting pixels... to moving worlds.",
  "section": "s8"
 }
}